    {
      "text": "Combine water with apple peels and cores in a saucepan. Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat and simmer, stirring occasionally, until the apple flavor and color have permeated the water, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vGqRDjg9okbzIY1FBQQEVjXYrBA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/218977-fresh-homemade-apple-juice-ddmfs-step3-3x4-12969-12b422d4b5034e418f6cdbec578997d3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/218977/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strain apple juice into a mixing bowl; discard all solids. Stir in sugar until dissolved. Allow to cool for 30 minutes before drinking.",
